<!doctype html><html lang="my"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title><%= selected.title %> | Innocreation ERP</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/workspace.css"></head><body class="app-home"><header class="app-header"><a class="app-logo" href="/dashboard">INNOCREATION <span>/ ERP</span></a><div class="account-area"><% if(typeof user!=='undefined'&&Array.isArray(user.app_access)&&user.app_access.includes('inventory')){ %><%- include('partials/approval-notifications',{user,csrf}) %><% } %><a class="back-link" href="/dashboard">← Main Dashboard</a><form method="post" action="/logout"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><button class="logout">Logout</button></form></div></header><main class="module-content"><p class="eyebrow">OPERATIONS / <%= selected.title.toUpperCase() %></p><h1><%= selected.title %></h1><p class="muted"><%= selected.description %></p><div class="module-notice">ဤအပိုင်း၏ Menu ဖွဲ့စည်းပုံဖြစ်ပါသည်။ Data ထည့်သွင်းခြင်းနှင့် လုပ်ဆောင်ချက်များကို နောက်အဆင့်တွင် တည်ဆောက်မည်။</div><section class="menu-grid" aria-label="Planned module menus"><% selected.menus.forEach((menu,index)=>{ %><article class="menu-card"><span class="menu-index"><%= String(index+1).padStart(2,'0') %></span><h2><%= menu %></h2><span class="planned">ပြင်ဆင်ဆဲ</span></article><% }); %></section></main></body></html>